# Massacre Girl, Most Wanted's "whenever another creature or planeswalker you control dies" is a leaves-the-battlefield
# ability: it looks back to the board as it was before the event (CR 603.10a), so a creature dying at the same time as
# Hushbringer, Hushbringer included, doesn't cause it to trigger (Hushbringer's rulings). Bot1 casts Ornithopter and
# Massacre Girl on turn 1 and Hushbringer on turn 3; on turn 5 Pyroclasm kills Hushbringer and the Ornithopter together
# and Massacre Girl survives it: no damage to Bot2, no life for Bot1, and no +1/+1 counter for her.

